  "definition": "Infectious Waste Bench Top Facilities",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-08-01",
  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2208.04); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14025, eff 8-1-24",
